{
  "slug": "investment-framework",
  "name": "Investment Framework",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Personal investment decision meta-router — 12 frameworks (Modern Portfolio Theory, All Weather, Bogleheads, Barbell Strategy, Value Investing, Factor Investing, Dollar-Cost Averaging, Rebalancing, Behavioral Biases, Kelly Criterion, Korean Tax Optimization, Korean FIRE). Built on Korean tax regime (ISA, IRP, pension savings, health insurance dependents). NOT investment advice, NOT a stock recommender — provides decision structures only. Invoke /money.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `money` (Personal investment decision meta-router — auto-selects from 12 frameworks (MPT, All Weather, Bogleheads, Barbell, Value/Factor Investing, DCA, Rebalancing,…), `all-weather` (All Weather Portfolio (Ray Dalio, Bridgewater) — diversifies across assets that perform well in each of the four…), `barbell-strategy` (Barbell Strategy (Nassim Taleb, Antifragile) — 85–90% in safe assets + 10–15% in high-risk, high-convexity bets, avoiding the…), `behavioral-biases` (Behavioral Finance (Kahneman, Tversky, Thaler) — most investment failures stem from psychological and cognitive biases), `bogleheads` (Bogleheads philosophy (John Bogle, Vanguard) — low-cost index investing, 3-fund portfolio, efficient market hypothesis, costs as the only…), `dollar-cost-averaging` (Dollar-Cost Averaging (DCA) — buy at fixed intervals with fixed amounts), `factor-investing` (Factor Investing (Fama-French 3/5 factor) — explaining excess returns through a small number of systematic 'factors': Value, Size,…), `fire-korean` (Korean-style FIRE (Financial Independence, Retire Early) — adapting the 4% rule to Korea, with real estate weighting, National…), and 5 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install investment-framework@claude-community` from `ironyjk/investment-framework`.",
